-- ============================================================================
-- Smart Eye & Skin Specialist Hospital - FICTIONAL DEMO DATA
--
-- Everything in this file is invented for a college project: the patients, the
-- doctors, the visits, the diagnoses and the phone numbers (9000000001 ...).
-- Any resemblance to real people is accidental. NEVER put real patient data here.
--
-- The routing rules are DEMONSTRATION rules. They have not been validated by
-- clinicians and must not be used for real patients.
--
-- Safe to run more than once: every row has a fixed ID and uses INSERT IGNORE,
-- so running the file again does not create duplicates.
--
-- Run by hand:   mysql -u root -p smart_hospital < seed-demo.sql
-- (the application also loads this file automatically when the doctors table is empty)
--
-- Dates are relative to the moment you run the file, so the demo queue is always "today".
-- ============================================================================

